{"id":"en_i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers","title":"I Fix Cursed Books, I Keep Their Powers","titleEn":"I Fix Cursed Books, I Keep Their Powers","description":"A talented restorer of ancient texts takes on the task of protecting a strange library, drawn by the promise of a substantial income. The volumes in their care have been corrupted by malevolent shadows, and mending them allows the restorer to absorb potent abilities belonging to monsters. Alongside central figures who step out of the books, this restorer confronts shadow creatures born from the resentment of secondary characters, gradually overturning the fate that had been laid out for them. Those interested in following the series can find it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Good vs. Evil","Mind-Bending","Short Drama"],"featured":true,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fho/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fho/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fho/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/u4pczv0.v774fho/","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-fix-cursed-books-i-keep-their-powers